{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Hk2wRmWEs51795183244.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>烏克蘭指受到俄軍大舉攻擊，至少八人死亡，十多人受傷。</p><p></p><p>其中在首都基輔有建築物受損，烏方稱有平民死亡，又指俄軍通宵向烏克蘭發射超過400架無人機，逾110枚導彈，部分帶有集束彈頭，據報基輔有三座大橋受俄軍襲擊。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.UKRAINE-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SHXv776Ted1795183253.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>烏克蘭早前再攻擊連接俄羅斯和克里米亞半島的克里米亞大橋後，俄羅斯總統普京表明會報復。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:03:55.698556+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T13:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T18:48:53.784291+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T14:57:18.866162+00:00","content_hash":"a3de2c90e892c267cb4d67f6c069817385d7e26962c91cfd974420ff7f9c9870","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:03:55.698556+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}